   711	    the dedicated generator's stream, in item order --- and only then does any
   712	    per-sample work. That ordering is what makes the assignment independent of
   713	    how the loader chunks the split. Each sample's PRE-rotation identity is
   714	    recorded into ``stream`` before it is rotated, so the audit describes the item
   715	    rather than the rotation.
   716	
   717	    Both ``generator`` and ``stream`` are required in random mode: a missing
